{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380320/extras/portraits.png?t=1745314309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You don't need to read any manuals! Visual tutorials teach you the game rules and how to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a non-Euclidean geometric minesweeper game that is logically solvable without guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It uses our original game engine developed for hyperbolic geometry and our original puzzle solver optimized for minesweeper problems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play this well-known genre of game in a warped space and solve all problems using only pure logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Of course standard features like quick marking, quick opening and undo functions are available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380320/extras/video-0.gif?t=1745314309\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Eight types of tessellation patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Easy and hard logic difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Large range of game field sizes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Number of mines can be set in custom mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Problem IDs enable time trials with your mates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Light, dark, classic and modern themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Independent volume control and mute functions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Settings and game data are automatically saved.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Portrait orientation modes not using screen rotation feature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3380320/extras/video-1.gif?t=1745314309\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3380320?t=1745314309","background_raw":"htt